msgid ""
"The Fedora :doc:`template </user/templates/templates>` is the default "
"template in Qubes OS. The current version is Fedora 42. This page is about "
"the “full” Fedora templates. For the minimal version, please see the :doc:"
"`Minimal templates </user/templates/minimal-templates>` page."
msgstr ""

